{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arquillian/arquillian-core/pulls/764", "id": 2921965834, "node_id": "PR_kwDOABgiWM6uKakK", "html_url": "https://github.com/arquillian/arquillian-core/pull/764", "diff_url": "https://github.com/arquillian/arquillian-core/pull/764.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/arquillian/arquillian-core/pull/764.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arquillian/arquillian-core/issues/764", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arquillian/arquillian-core/pulls/764/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arquillian/arquillian-core/pulls/764/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arquillian/arquillian-core/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arquillian/arquillian-core/issues/764/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arquillian/arquillian-core/statuses/b5bd8d77a2abf810c6310033c9aa573d189f6722", "number": 764, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Flaky Test Fixed in test/impl-base Module", "user": {"login": "lycoris106", "id": 53146702, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTQ2NzAy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53146702?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106", "html_url": "https://github.com/lycoris106", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## Problem\r\nThe flakiness/non-determinism in the test`shouldBeAbleToInjectBaseContextOnMethodWithQualifier` in module `test/impl-base` was found with [NonDex](https://github.com/TestingResearchIllinois/NonDex) tool. Runtime exception `All Providers for type class java.lang.Object returned a null value` was triggered with certain random seeds. This is due to the non-determinism from `Method.getParameterAnnotations()`, which returns annotations on each parameter, but the order of multiple annotations on the SAME parameter is not guaranteed by the Java specification. \r\n\r\n```\r\nresourceMethod.getParameterAnnotations()[0][1].getClass()\r\n```\r\nThis original statement falsely assumes that the annotation on index 1 is the target, but different internal states (randomly set by NonDex) may return these annotations in different orders. With some seeds, the `lookup` would end up matching with the wrong class and in turn triggers the exception in `lookup`.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nCheck each annotation iteratively without assuming the index:\r\n```\r\nfor (Annotation ann : resourceMethod.getParameterAnnotations()[0]) {\r\n   ...\r\n}\r\n```\r\nThis does not weaken the test since it still verifies the correct annotation type (`ArquillianTestQualifier`) is passed to `lookup()`.\r\n\r\n## Reproduce\r\nThe test error can be reproduced with NonDex with command: \r\n\r\n```\r\nmvn -pl test/impl-base edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:2.1.7:nondex \\\r\nDtest=org.jboss.arquillian.test.impl.enricher.resource.ArquillianResourceTestEnricherTestCase#shouldBeAbleToInjectBaseContextOnMethodWithQualifier`\r\n```\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nFix flaky test in test/impl-base by dynamically locating the qualifier annotation instead of assuming a fixed annotation index\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Eliminate nondeterminism in shouldBeAbleToInjectBaseContextOnMethodWithQualifier by avoiding hardcoded annotation index\n\nTests:\n- Iterate through parameter annotations to find the ArquillianTestQualifier dynamically in the test", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:54:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-19T17:08:05Z", "closed_at": "2025-11-19T17:07:53Z", "merged_at": "2025-11-19T17:07:53Z", "merge_commit_sha": "90e07d51b1176837d37452022d1416fffa099734", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "lycoris106:fix-flaky-test", "ref": "fix-flaky-test", "repo": {"id": 1077808172, "node_id": "R_kgDOQD4MLA", "name": "arquillian-core", "full_name": "lycoris106/arquillian-core", "owner": {"login": "lycoris106", "id": 53146702, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTQ2NzAy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53146702?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106", "html_url": "https://github.com/lycoris106", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "private": false, "fork": true, "archived": false, "disabled": false, "description": "Arquillian provides a component model for integration tests, which includes dependency injection and container life cycle management. Instead of managing a runtime in your test, Arquillian brings your test to the runtime.", "homepage": "http://arqui